    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, weight loss, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or tightness; no nitroglycerin use</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No trouble passing urine or retention</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low back pain and stiffness; no leg pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness, tingling, weakness, or saddle numbness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

